# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored. Never commit real keys.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING — read before shipping
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix is not a naming convention. It is Expo's explicit
# instruction to inline the value into the JavaScript bundle at build time.
# Every key below is therefore SHIPPED INSIDE THE APP and can be extracted from
# a distributed build in minutes (unzip the .ipa and grep main.jsbundle, or
# point a proxy at the app and read the request headers).
#
# This is acceptable for LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY.
#
# Before any App Store or TestFlight release, EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY must
# be removed and the Claude call moved behind a server-side endpoint that holds
# the key. Anthropic keys have no scopes and no spend restriction of their own —
# a leaked key is full, unbounded access to its workspace.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# Google Places API key — powers place search on the Save screen.
# Used by: src/app/save.tsx
#
# Without it: place search silently returns no results. The app still runs.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/ — enable "Places API".
# Lock it down: restrict the key to the Places API only and set a daily quota
# cap. (Note: this app uses the Places *web service* REST endpoints via
# react-native-google-places-autocomplete, where bundle-ID restrictions are
# weak — the API restriction and quota cap are the protections that matter.)
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API key — powers AI itinerary generation on the Route tab.
# Used by: lib/itinerary.ts
#
# Without it: generating an itinerary throws an error. The rest of the app runs.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/
# Use a DEDICATED WORKSPACE with a hard spend limit set, so a leak or a runaway
# loop is bounded. Do not reuse a key that has access to anything else.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
